113
00:09:38,020 --> 00:09:41,220
It's the perfect time for revenge

114
00:09:47,760 --> 00:09:49,160
Mr. Conductor?

115
00:09:49,420 --> 00:09:51,460
Anyone there? Hello?

116
00:09:55,580 --> 00:09:57,660
Yugi, what are you doing?

117
00:09:58,540 --> 00:10:04,000
I've got to get in there so I
can stop this train But how?

118
00:10:04,340 --> 00:10:09,800
I have an idea There may be an
emergency hatch on the roof Be careful

119
00:10:14,140 --> 00:10:15,180
Weevil Underwood

120
00:10:15,800 --> 00:10:17,300
Are you behind this?

121
00:10:17,780 --> 00:10:20,015
You'd better start explaining yourself

122
00:10:21,180 --> 00:10:23,709
Weevil, what do you
want with us, worm boy?

123
00:10:23,840 --> 00:10:25,400
What do you think I want?

124
00:10:25,560 --> 00:10:29,900
A rematch with the king
of games Are you nuts?

125
00:10:30,100 --> 00:10:34,680
I'm just in the mood for a friendly
duel Weevil, who put you up to this?

126
00:10:35,680 --> 00:10:36,880
No one did.

127
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:41,711
I figured this was a good time to test
out my new secret weapon, that's all.

128
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:48,440
It's that magic rock the
professor told us about it.

129
00:10:49,120 --> 00:10:51,238
Where'd you find that thing, Raptor?

130
00:10:51,340 --> 00:10:52,360
I knew it.

131
00:10:52,520 --> 00:10:53,814
He's working for them.

132
00:10:56,660 --> 00:10:58,640
