145
00:11:24,380 --> 00:11:25,800
To make him pay!

146
00:11:26,020 --> 00:11:29,480
By sealing him away! No! Don't worry!

147
00:11:30,020 --> 00:11:33,432
Soon you'll be locked away
with your friend Yugi, Pharaoh.

148
00:11:34,500 --> 00:11:36,720
Where is he? Tell me!

149
00:11:37,020 --> 00:11:40,040
I'm afraid the only way
to find out is to duel me.

150
00:11:40,280 --> 00:11:44,277
So if you back down now, then you'll
never see that little twerp again.

151
00:11:44,360 --> 00:11:46,260
Very well. Then let's duel.

152
00:11:48,520 --> 00:11:50,040
Wise choice, Pharaoh.

153
00:11:52,420 --> 00:11:54,080
I'm gonna enjoy this.

154
00:11:56,580 --> 00:11:58,860
What'd you do to my friends? Nothing.

155
00:11:59,340 --> 00:12:03,380
Weevil's dealing with those losers
while I handle you two. Weevil?

156
00:12:03,560 --> 00:12:05,360
So he's in on this thing, too?

157
00:12:05,660 --> 00:12:09,440
Rex, you guys picked the wrong
side to join. Oh, really?

158
00:12:09,700 --> 00:12:12,171
Well, we'll just see about that, won't we?

159
00:12:14,680 --> 00:12:17,920
I've been given more power
than you ever dreamed of.

160
