sorry behind, but you're half my size.

162
00:12:23,560 --> 00:12:26,637
So why don't you get out of
my way before I step on you?

163
00:12:26,720 --> 00:12:27,550
Sorry, pal.

164
00:12:28,100 --> 00:12:30,218
I'm not going anywhere till we duel.

165
00:12:30,480 --> 00:12:33,186
So draw your cards and
let's get it on, chump.

166
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:35,880
I've got a duel to win. Now what?

167
00:12:36,560 --> 00:12:37,620
