168
00:12:38,040 --> 00:12:41,057
Now let's trample this geek
and then go find Yugi and Taya.

169
00:12:41,140 --> 00:12:42,540
Good call. Oh, yeah?

170
00:12:42,840 --> 00:12:46,180
