179
00:13:22,860 --> 00:13:25,200
Now, that's what I call power.

180
00:13:26,200 --> 00:13:28,200
What was he thinking playing that?

181
00:13:28,620 --> 00:13:29,720
Careful, man.

182
00:13:30,040 --> 00:13:32,864
