on this duel big time.

183
00:13:33,080 --> 00:13:36,460
Now whoever loses the
game loses their soul.

184
00:13:36,820 --> 00:13:38,497
Gee, thanks for the reminder.

185
00:13:38,580 --> 00:13:39,540
Let's do this.

186
00:13:39,700 --> 00:13:41,080
It's payback time.

187
00:13:41,520 --> 00:13:42,620
Sorry, Rex.

188
00:13:43,200 --> 00:13:44,580
I won't duel.

189
00:13:44,980 --> 00:13:46,780
You don't have much choice.

190
00:13:50,720 --> 00:13:53,077
I've improved since our last duel.

191
00:13:53,160 --> 00:13:56,060
But you'll see that for
yourself soon enough.

192
00:13:56,280 --> 00:13:57,580
