Ha ha ha!

202
00:14:30,780 --> 00:14:32,240
Now it's my turn!

203
00:14:32,520 --> 00:14:35,402
I need to experience this
card's power firsthand.

204
00:14:35,700 --> 00:14:38,940
And when you lose, you'll
join your little friend.

205
00:14:39,720 --> 00:14:44,340
