you're putting yourself in danger also.

206
00:14:44,580 --> 00:14:46,340
Thanks for the advice, Taya.

207
00:14:46,600 --> 00:14:47,700
But who asked?

208
00:14:53,680 --> 00:14:54,760
No!

209
00:15:02,740 --> 00:15:03,820
Tia!

210
00:15:04,540 --> 00:15:05,880
Are you all right?

211
00:15:07,500 --> 00:15:09,380
Yeah, I'm okay.

212
00:15:09,920 --> 00:15:10,750
Good.

213
00:15:16,060 --> 00:15:17,500
All right.

214
00:15:17,980 --> 00:15:19,880
I'm ready to duel.

215
00:15:23,160 --> 00:15:25,278
Looks like the battles are underway.

216
00:15:25,540 --> 00:15:26,480
Yes, master.

217
00:15:26,820 --> 00:15:30,644
And if all goes well, the soul of
the pharaoh will soon be yours.

218
00:15:31,080 --> 00:15:33,600
Of course, we win no matter what.

219
00:15:33,860 --> 00:15:37,900
Because whatever the final
outcome is, we get two souls.

220
00:15:41,240 --> 00:15:44,500
Since I challenged you,
I'll start things off.

221
00:15:44,900 --> 00:15:48,960
And I'll play my good
friend, pheromone wasp.

222
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:53,780
It's not strong now,

223
00:15:53,960 --> 00:15:58,140
but the power of the Seal of
Aurichalcos gives it a 500-point boost.

224
00:15:58,520 --> 00:16:01,960
