cards! Hold on! Don't do it!

231
00:16:22,600 --> 00:16:23,680
Celtic Guardian!

232
00:16:24,040 --> 00:16:26,120
Crush his pheromone wasp now!

233
00:16:27,140 --> 00:16:28,760
