235
00:16:31,280 --> 00:16:33,600
A handy little card called Mimesis!

236
00:16:34,260 --> 00:16:35,090
No!

237
00:16:35,540 --> 00:16:36,370
Yup!

238
00:16:36,453 --> 00:16:39,900
It allows me to trade in my
insect monster for another one!

239
00:16:40,040 --> 00:16:44,337
So I get to choose which monster your
obnoxious Celtic Guardian attacks!

240
00:16:44,420 --> 00:16:48,560
And now my pheromone
wasp, return to my hand!

241
